https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967310/extras/7b180b1716e6fac3254ce922194a46f0.webm?t=1681448036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967310/extras/7b180b1716e6fac3254ce922194a46f0.mp4?t=1681448036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This game is about avoiding the dragon's attacks for 200 seconds. The dragon is designed with various skills, such as flame attacks, electric attacks, and ice attacks, to increase the user's fun.",
